## Agent snippets

These snippets show what an [insight agent](/spotfire-mods/docs/action-mods/insight-agent-tutorial/) can do during the insight phase, such as running data transformations and data functions in the background.
Each snippet shows the command to add the agent, its entry in the `agents` array of the mod manifest, and its source code.
Add an agent to your mod with `npx @spotfire/mods-sdk add-agent <id> --name "<name>" --type <visual|marking>`.
